vanilla Pokémon Platinum encounter data, which would be wrong for this hack. Renegade Platinum also changes some Pokémon base stats and types (documented in Drayano's 'Pokémon Changes' and 'Type Changes' docs, e.g. Mismagius becomes Ghost/Fairy, Luxray Electric/Dark, Electivire Electric/Fighting); those stat/type overrides are intentionally NOT captured in this pack and are left for a future pass.","sourceDocs":["https://projectpokemon.org/home/profile/5596-drayano/content/?change_section=1","https://fredericdlugi.github.io/platinum-renegade-wiki/","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Gym_Leader","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Roark","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Gardenia","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Fantina","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Maylene","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Wake","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Byron","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Candice","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Volkner","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Aaron","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Bertha","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Flint","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Lucian","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Elite_4","https://pokemonrenegadeplatinum.fandom.com/wiki/Cynthia"],"version":"1.3.0"}